team, Corrode just died in the jaws of a centipede.
Does it make sense that pets incapable of inflicting
any HP damage at all choose to attack monsters? I
don't think so.

Hmm, _peaceful_ monsters are even more problematical
for my "wet and a weed" pets to be attacking on my
behalf. Luckily I'm chaotic so the usual demurrers
don't apply. Bye, peaceful goblin!

Oops, and there's that long expected YASD -- I
missed a "you return to orcish form" (aren't I
supposed to have to _die_ to have that happen???)
and tried to fight a mean-tempered dwarf bare-handed
and buck naked.  Sigh.

To repeat what  I started to say before this game
got interesting for a moment, "this, chillun, is why
I haven't ascended in over 17 years".



